.gpt_case_unsafe_assignment_01.stage.stage_2.exhibits.0.content.en"],"verbatimSpan":"increases the norepinephrine to 6 mcg/min per the titration protocol"},"bilingualRelation":"PARALLEL","reason":"The tested reasoning is that preset vasoactive drips still require the primary nurse to titrate; Stage 2 demonstrates precisely that by having the drip need a protocol titration half an hour later, plus the twelve-minute delay showing the call-me workaround fails. Because the item is anchored at the 1940 conversation, that later demonstration is unnecessary exposure and the Chinese stage text states the same titration to 6 mcg/min."}
